<title>USA: Whitman Corp Q4 net off after charge.</title>
<headline>Whitman Corp Q4 net off after charge.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.27		    $0.32</p>
<p> Net			 28,800		   34,000</p>
<p> Revs		     824,500		  790,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 105,000		  106,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.31		    $1.26</p>
<p> Net			139,400		  133,500</p>
<p> Revs		   3,111,300		2,946,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 106,400		  106,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 and 12-mos net and shr include after-tax charge of $8.7 million, or $7.0 million after minority interest, on asset write-down of soft-drink operations in Poland. The charge reduced EPS by $0.07 for Q4 and 12-mos.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
